alized_name": "speaker_2_ref_text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 4, "type": "FishS2MultiSpeakerTTS", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "FishS2MultiSpeakerTTS"}, "order": 5}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": ["# Fish Audio S2 TTS\n\n## Auto-Download\n\n**Models auto-download on first run** - no manual setup needed!\n\n| Model | VRAM | Size |\n|-------|------|------|\n| s2-pro (bf16) | ~24GB | ~10GB |\n| s2-pro-fp8 | ~20GB | ~8GB |\n| s2-pro-BNB-int8 | ~20GB | ~10GB |\n| s2-pro-BNB-nf4 | ~16GB  | ~10GB  |\n---\n\n## Manual Download\n\n| File | Size | Link |\n|------|------|------|\n| s2-pro (Full) | ~10GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/s2-pro) |\n| s2-pro-fp8 | ~8GB | [Download](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/s2-pro-fp8) |\n\n\nPlace in:\n```\nComfyUI/models/FishAudioS2/\n├── s2-pro/\n│   ├── config.json\n│   ├── model.safetensors\n│   └── ...\n└── s2-pro-fp8/\n    ├── config.json\n    ├── model.safetensors\n    └── ...\n```\n\n---\n\n## BNB Model use the s2-pro model as base and quantise on the fly using bitsandbytes\n\n---\n\n## Common tags (15,000+ unique tags supported):\n\n## [pause] [emphasis] [laughing] [inhale] [chuckle] [tsk] [singing] [excited] [laughing tone] [interrupting] [chuckling] [excited tone] [volume up] [echo] [angry] [low volume] [sigh] [low voice] [whisper] [screaming] [shouting] [loud] [surprised] [short pause] [exhale] [delight] [panting] [audience laughter] [with strong accent] [volume down] [clearing throat] [sad] [moaning] [shocked]\n\n---\n\n## Links\n\n- Original [fish-speech](https://github.com/fishaudio/fish-speech)\n- Models [s2-pro](https://huggingface.co/fishaudio/s2-pro) / [s2-pro-fp8](https://huggingface.co/drbaph/s2-pro-fp8)\n- Issues [Report Bug](https://github.com/Saganaki22/ComfyUI-FishAudioS2/issues)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#355", "size": [387.5457458496094, 699.7141723632812], "pos": [2590.050048828125, 479.4713134765625], "id": 1, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 2}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["[speaker_1]: 哥，你哪来的手机。\n[speaker_2]: 压岁钱买的，别告诉妈妈啊，不然我让你口水流到脚丫子上。\n[speaker_1]:你还信不过我吗？出了名的嘴严。\n[speaker_2]: 嘴严还能管不住自己的口水。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [369, 170.70001220703125], "pos": [1773.577880859375, 1334.14208984375], "id": 7, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 3}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["[speaker_1]: 一讲题，你就摆这副脸！写错作业还不让人说了？辅导你一回作业，我最少少活半年!\n[speaker_2]: 不可能.\n[speaker_1]:啥不可能啊?\n[speaker_2]: 要是辅导一次少活半年，那你早就没啦！\n[speaker_1]:这题有那么费劲吗？你看，让你用'象'造句，你可以写：妈妈像大明星，妈妈像天使，多简单！\n[speaker_2]: 这是造句，不是造谣。\n[speaker_1]:管它造句还是造谣，你就这么写。\n[speaker_2]: 真写不了!\n[speaker_1]:怎么写不了呀？\n[speaker_2]: 昧着良心写，我的良心会疼！\n[speaker_1]:哎哟，我的妈呀！！"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [369, 170.70001220703125], "pos": [1260.654296875, 1351.29345703125], "id": 9, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [-800.4784589509154, -525.2853303363705], "scale": 0.7513148009015781}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "Fish Audio S2 Multi talk", "bounding": [1214.3056640625, 422, 1318.9654541015625, 815.9447631835938]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 50, "flags": {}, "id": 2, "title": "🗝️FishAudio S2 双人对话配音工作流（克隆与情感对话）", "bounding": [1213.943603515625, 327.9482116699219, 1320.505859375, 80]}], "links": [[1, 4, 0, 3, 0, "AUDIO"], [6, 2, 0, 4, 17, "AUDIO"], [7, 5, 0, 4, 19, "AUDIO"]], "id": "664b7bbc-cabf-4b31-a028-cb03209bc94b", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 9, "revision": 0}